Output ../public/demos/experiments.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 640
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "source /labnotes/docs/demos/setup.sh; uvx labnotes experiments sweep run --concurrency 8 > /dev/null; clear"
Enter
Sleep 45s
Show

Type "uvx labnotes experiments"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "uvx labnotes experiments sweep"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "uvx labnotes experiments sweep runs"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
